        "username": "Omegatron",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omegatron/{size}/4904_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-12-07T09:56:17.787Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There’s a tip I saw from someone else that makes this one pretty easy.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nTip</summary>\n<p>Have the Southwest Sentinels play Blackout and hit Sergeant Steel (or whichever of his agents has the highest damage boost, but usually Sergeant Steel) to make him hit all the villains. Then Argent Adept can retrieve that card with Vernal Sonata and make them play it again with his base power.</p>\n</details>\n<p>Keep doing that at every opportunity and the villains fall quickly.</p>",
