      {
        "id": 249919,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-12-08T16:55:57.543Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, I got a mint, but boy it was dangerously close.</p>\n<p>I made the mistake of deciding to use the first round to power people up, and let Captain Cosmic be the one to destroy A World Reborn. The result of that was that I missed out on enough early villain damage that everything cascaded badly for me. In the end, it was down to the Sentinels alone, rapid-playing Mainstay’s defensive power and using a lot of ping healing as they whittled down Sergeant Steel, the Operative, and La Capitan alone.</p>\n<p>And somehow they won!</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-12-08T16:55:57.543Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 18,
        "readers_count": 17,
        "score": 18.6,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 29778,
