        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Well, I got a mint, but boy it was dangerously close.\n\nI made the mistake of deciding to use the first round to power people up, and let Captain Cosmic be the one to destroy A World Reborn. The result of that was that I missed out on enough early villain damage that everything cascaded badly for me. In the end, it was down to the Sentinels alone, rapid-playing Mainstay's defensive power and using a lot of ping healing as they whittled down Sergeant Steel, the Operative, and La Capitan alone.\n\nAnd somehow they won!",
