        ],
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "![Screenshot_20221208-212740|219x500](upload://euEVXmQDDpnK8Rltpy9xPKeP0uW.jpeg)\nPlayed this one off and on for days before achieving an unexpected Mint. I focused on Miss Info first, then largely targeted whichever opponent had been weakened the most by global damage from heroes, the environment, and Sarge and his crew. This, as it turned out, was Sergeant Steel himself, followed by The Operative. I lost Writhe and Idealist of the Sentinels during the battle, but Doctor Medico was able to revive them.\nThen I turned my attention to La Capitan and her little friend - and in a perfectly timed coincidence, discovered that while Fixed Point is in play, Chiquito can't destroy the cards he has stolen, so he can't prevent damage to himself or La Capitan.\nI was uncertain for a good part of the game whether I would prevail, so it felt great to finish with my whole team standing, after a ferocious fight!",
